    "description": "Open Mentalism 2.4 - Cloaking. Spells for hiding, disguising and duplicating the caster, and for shifting probable attacks off-target, including the Cloaking, Cloaking Sphere, Facades, Shadow Mentalist and Displacement families. Special Notes: (1) Cloaking spells are not Invisibility spells and none of the normal rules for invisibility apply (e.g., the caster does not become \"visible\" when he attacks or is hit, etc.). (2) See Section 15.14 (p. 98) for more on illusions.",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "01. Blur",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": true,
          "level": 1,
          "area_of_effect": "caster",
          "duration": "1 min/lvl",
          "range": "self",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Causes caster to appear blurred to attackers, subtracting 10 from all attacks directed at the caster."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "02. Shadow",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 2,
          "area_of_effect": "caster",
          "duration": "10 min/lvl",
          "range": "self",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster and objects on his person appear to be a shadow; and thus are almost invisible in dark areas (e.g., in many situations this could be handled with a special bonus between +25 and +75 to Stalking/Hiding maneuvers)."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "03. Unseen",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 3,
          "area_of_effect": "object",
          "duration": "24 hours",
          "range": "touch",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "A single object is made invisible (1 garment, 1 naked body, etc.); until 24 hours pass or the object is struck by a violent blow (being hit by a weapon, falling, etc.) or the object makes a violent move (i.e., an attack). See Section 15.5 (p. 96) for more on Invisibility."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "04. Cloaking I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 4,
          "area_of_effect": "1 target",
          "duration": "1 min/lvl(C)",
          "range": "10'/lvl",
          "type": "F",
          "subType": "m",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "[RR Mod: -50] Target makes an RR. Failure results in the caster being invisible to the target; others see the caster normally. If the caster makes an obvious action (e.g., talking, moving an object, etc.), the target may make another RR (the GM may deem it appropriate to apply modifiers to this RR based upon the action the caster takes). If the caster attacks the target, he may make another RR with a special modifier of +50. If the caster begins to concentrate (50% activity), he can extend the duration of this spell indefinitely (as long as he can concentrate)."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "05. Facades I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 5,
          "area_of_effect": "caster",
          "duration": "1 hr/lvl",
          "range": "self",
          "type": "E",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "A limited illusion that allows the caster to look like any humanoid figure within 20% of his own size. See Section 15.14 (p. 98) for more on illusions."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "06. Cloaking III",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
