          "type": "F",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Creates a duplicate of the caster; if he concentrates, it will move as he wills; otherwise, it does exactly as he does. The duplicate is limited to moving within the area of effect. If the caster concentrates, he can \"merge\" the duplicate with himself and then split back apart again (making it difficult to discern which one is the \"real\" caster)."
