          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster and objects on his person take on the visual texture, color, and form of surrounding area. Caster is nearly invisible when motionless (a special bonus of +200 to all Hiding maneuvers) and has a special bonus of +50 to Stalking maneuvers (if he concentrates). This spell is not cumulative with Shadow."
